{title: Dayaghana}
{artist: Suresh Wadkar Hridaynath Mangeshkar}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D],        dayaghana,
[D] [F#m] [D],        ka tutale chimane gharate
[D] [G],        uralo bandi tujha mi
[D],        dayaghana,
[D],        are, janm bandivas
[F#m] [D],        saja ithe pratyekas
[D],        chuke na kunas aata
[G],        Bandi Tuza mi
[D],        dayaghana
daha dishanchi kothadi,        moha-maaya jhali vedi
puran maajhe oodhi,        dayaghana
baalapan utu gele,        taarunya naasale
vaaradhakya saachale,        dayaghana
